E AX3013 110-partial-application.ax:7:4-7 partial-application "partial application of `add`: it takes 2 argument(s) and 1 were supplied" #"`add` takes 2 argument(s); 1 more needed" !"a partial application has to hold the arguments it was not given, and a top-level function has no closure record to hold them in" ?"bind the missing arguments with a lambda: `(lambda (y) (f x y))` builds the value `(f x)` would mean"
E AX3013 1014-primitive-value.ax:23:4-16 partial-application "partial application of `__floatToInt`: it takes 1 argument(s) and 0 were supplied" #"`__floatToInt` takes 1 argument(s), so it cannot be used as a bare value" !"a primitive is lowered in place at each call and has no function symbol, so a bare reference to one has no value to take" ?"call it, or wrap it in a lambda to pass it as a value: `(lambda (x) (__floatToInt x))`"
E AX3013 1014-primitive-value.ax:27:10-23 partial-application "partial application of `__atomic_load`: it takes 1 argument(s) and 0 were supplied" #"`__atomic_load` takes 1 argument(s), so it cannot be used as a bare value" !"a primitive is lowered in place at each call and has no function symbol, so a bare reference to one has no value to take" ?"call it, or wrap it in a lambda to pass it as a value: `(lambda (x) (__atomic_load x))`"
E AX3004 450-effect-op-arity.ax:31:6-9 type-mismatch "type mismatch: expected function type, found Int" #"this has type `Int`, expected `function type`"
W AX3038 450-effect-op-arity.ax:31:6-9 effect-unverifiable "handled-effects list cannot be checked: the body calls a value the compiler could not resolve" ?"name the function at the call, or widen the handled list: an unresolved call may perform any effect, and reaching one with no handler aborts the process"
E AX3013 450-effect-op-arity.ax:40:6-9 partial-application "partial application of `two`: it takes 2 argument(s) and 1 were supplied" #"`two` takes 2 argument(s); 1 more needed" !"a partial application has to hold the arguments it was not given, and a top-level function has no closure record to hold them in" ?"bind the missing arguments with a lambda: `(lambda (y) (f x y))` builds the value `(f x)` would mean"
E AX3131 arity-compute.ax:7:34-40 compute-callback "compute callback is opaque here or its parameter has no matching compute contract" ?"pass a numeric lambda, a checked named function, or the exact parameter carrying compute; use canonical primitive captures, numeric operations and local accumulators; raw/runtime observers, references, heap stores, allocation and opaque calls are refused"
E AX3131 arity-compute.ax:9:25-32 compute-callback "compute callback must be a non-nullary numeric function with a visible body" ?"pass a numeric lambda, a checked named function, or the exact parameter carrying compute; use canonical primitive captures, numeric operations and local accumulators; raw/runtime observers, references, heap stores, allocation and opaque calls are refused"
E AX3015 arity-signature-only.ax:1:5-12 missing-definition "`unknown` has a signature but no definition" #"no `fn` defines `unknown`" ?"add the definition, or if it lives in another module, mark that definition `pub` so the import carries it"
E AX3055 arity-poison-operation.ax:1:14-21 effect-op-untyped "operation `missing` of effect `Bad` declares no type; a handler is checked against it and a call is checked against its arity" #"no `::` type after the operation's name" ?"write `(missing :: (-> Arg Result))`"
E AX3053 arity-poison-operation.ax:3:6-10 unhandled-operation "`main` reaches operation `missing` of effect `Bad` with no handler: the process would write `axiom: unhandled effect` and exit 71 there - in `main`'s own body" #"reaches `Bad` with nothing handling it" ?"install one - `(handle BODY (E) HANDLER)` around the call - or, if an unhandled operation of this effect is a deliberate abort as `Assert`'s is, write `;@axiom:unhandled(trap)` above its `effect` declaration"
